<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">rhetoric</ansi>

<ansi fg="stat">Rhetoric</ansi> is a combat skill governing verbal and social
attacks. It determines your effectiveness with conviction
damage — attacks that target an opponent's will to fight
rather than their body.

<ansi fg="yellow">Primary Stat:</ansi> <ansi fg="stat">Charisma</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Progression:</ansi>

  Rhetoric progresses through use, like all skills. Each
  time you use a rhetoric-based ability (such as
  <ansi fg="command">taunt</ansi>), there is a chance your skill rank
  increases. Higher ranks improve both your hit chance
  and damage output.

<ansi fg="yellow">Effects of Rank:</ansi>

  - Higher rhetoric increases your conviction damage
    multiplier (1.0x at rank 0, up to 3.0x at rank 50)
  - Adds to your hit check when attacking with taunt
  - Adds to your defense when targeted by taunt

<ansi fg="yellow">Profession:</ansi> Orator (Rhetoric + Bartering)

<ansi fg="yellow">Abilities:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">taunt</ansi>  — Verbal assault that deals conviction damage
             and forces the target to attack you
  <ansi fg="command">warcry</ansi> — Battle cry that boosts physical damage for
             all allies in the room
  <ansi fg="command">rally</ansi>  — Rallying shout that improves dodge, parry,
             and block for all allies in the room

All three share the special move cooldown.

